{"baseline":{"amendments":[{"artifact_ref":"specs/082-output-content-validation/campaign-example-renewal-lineup.json","locator":"cases/sensor-fan-harness-02/final_deliverable","sha256":"9a7992ac2ec340b7e8fb511b16b87d1effd341dc5e768cd81834065e891ef199"}],"id":"sensor-fan-harness-02-basis","requirements":[{"id":"HARNESS02-TOPOLOGY","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/wiring-schedule.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"b5a8acef1aa6a4cfff02e0701e1461e05fc2d618b7138ece9c9df40268da0473"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/context.md","locator":"Route and nets","sha256":"a78fcff0ffde1813b725873c9565e1f60236c9e78dcddd2ebc3164d9a5a7caf7"}],"text":"The harness preserves all declared pins/nets, separate +24V and POWER_GND splices at B0, continuous SIGNAL_RETURN to J0 pin 6, and a controller-only star-point connection."},{"id":"HARNESS02-CURRENTS","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/wiring-schedule.csv","locator":"current_cont_A,current_start_A","sha256":"b5a8acef1aa6a4cfff02e0701e1461e05fc2d618b7138ece9c9df40268da0473"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/context.md","locator":"Operating conditions; Route and nets","sha256":"a78fcff0ffde1813b725873c9565e1f60236c9e78dcddd2ebc3164d9a5a7caf7"}],"text":"Shared-trunk sizing uses simultaneous startup of both fans and transmitter: 4.025 A on +24V and 4.0 A on POWER_GND; each branch retains its declared continuous/start current."},{"id":"HARNESS02-DROP","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/allowed-wire.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"dc791d7c6604503f1921ccf5bc2a882a1c95c923ae3abb5a249176ce696f8461"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/wiring-schedule.csv","locator":"all power rows","sha256":"b5a8acef1aa6a4cfff02e0701e1461e05fc2d618b7138ece9c9df40268da0473"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/context.md","locator":"Fabrication capability and policies","sha256":"a78fcff0ffde1813b725873c9565e1f60236c9e78dcddd2ebc3164d9a5a7caf7"}],"text":"Every loaded branch, including the farthest fan, remains at or below 0.72 V in separate continuous and simultaneous-start cases using both shared and branch supply/return paths at 45 °C."},{"id":"HARNESS02-CUT-LENGTHS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/wiring-schedule.csv","locator":"route_mm","sha256":"b5a8acef1aa6a4cfff02e0701e1461e05fc2d618b7138ece9c9df40268da0473"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/context.md","locator":"Fabrication capability and policies","sha256":"a78fcff0ffde1813b725873c9565e1f60236c9e78dcddd2ebc3164d9a5a7caf7"}],"text":"The cut list uses each unique centerline route, 50 mm service length at each connector termination plus documented strip/crimp allowance, and never double-counts shared trunks."},{"id":"HARNESS02-CONNECTORS","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/connector-requirements.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"f405c94811aa7304495089bfe17b4ba6324704c70ed5de8f5b3f77296e25fb75"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/context.md","locator":"Assembly and procurement needs; Fabrication capability and policies","sha256":"a78fcff0ffde1813b725873c9565e1f60236c9e78dcddd2ebc3164d9a5a7caf7"}],"text":"Selected sourced connector/splice parts and tools meet declared pin counts, 30 V, 45 °C derating, at least 5 A at J0/B0, 3 A at fan connectors and 0.1 A at signal contacts."},{"id":"HARNESS02-SERVICE","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/context.md","locator":"Assembly and procurement needs","sha256":"a78fcff0ffde1813b725873c9565e1f60236c9e78dcddd2ebc3164d9a5a7caf7"}],"text":"Fans unplug independently, the common trunk has abrasion sleeve and clips at no more than 300 mm spacing, and the harness remains at least 50 mm from irrigation tubing."},{"id":"HARNESS02-SIGNALS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/wiring-schedule.csv","locator":"signal rows","sha256":"b5a8acef1aa6a4cfff02e0701e1461e05fc2d618b7138ece9c9df40268da0473"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/context.md","locator":"Route and nets","sha256":"a78fcff0ffde1813b725873c9565e1f60236c9e78dcddd2ebc3164d9a5a7caf7"}],"text":"FAN_A_TACH, FAN_B_TACH, HUM_SIGNAL and SIGNAL_RETURN remain on their declared pins, and open-collector tach compatibility is recorded as an assumption requiring selection verification."},{"id":"HARNESS02-VIEWS","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sensor-fan-harness/02-growth-rack-long-run/context.md","locator":"Outputs","sha256":"a78fcff0ffde1813b725873c9565e1f60236c9e78dcddd2ebc3164d9a5a7caf7"}],"text":"Connector views are explicitly mating-face or wire-entry and match the exact pin s